recommend keep-going the stereo span family stands whole (cut · crop · move beside replace); natural next rungs carry the stereo lockstep discipline to duplicate (ALES112), paste_over (ALES114), insert_silence (ALES109), or silence_span (ALES110) — each the mono op run per channel with validate-both; the loop stays Lindy-first crux-first; STOP remains at REMEMBER's custody gates
